		(property "Design Notes" "VOUT = VREF x (1 + R4/R5) with FB divider R4 41.2k / R5 10k (VOUT = 5.12 V for the Pi 5), C10 feed-forward; RT = R2 12.1k; EN tied to VIN; RBOOT shorted to CBOOT; SW pin left NC; PG open-drain, unused; VLDOIN tied to VOUT; VCC needs 1 uF to AGND per datasheet - CHECK C9 placement (currently on VLDOIN/VOUT, VCC flagged NC)"
