		(property "Description" "ST USBLC6-4SC6 4-line ESD array (SOT-23-6, ~3.5 pF, hand-solderable). VBUS tied to the rail the protected lines swing to, with 100 nF to GND at the pin. Place at the connector with short VBUS/GND paths. Protects J6 (motor 1 PWM and DIR, 3.3 V signals, VBUS = +3V3). I/O3-4 unused."
